              header on desktop (.table-toolbar is display:none there) and only
              join this row once the table collapses to cards ≤640px, where
              every control but the search goes icon/compact. All drive the same
              server refetch (initProductsToolbar / initPagination in
              products.ts). */}
          {/* The pager rides IN this row (owner, 2026-08-14: "בדסקטופ חבל על השורה"). Above 640px
              the row is a search pill at one end and a page-size pill at the other with nothing
              between them, and the pager was taking a whole line of its own to sit under that gap.

              `.dash-toolbar__controls` is `display:contents` there, so the three controls stay the
